Commit: c9b2dbf - Fix asset extraction from claim transaction: only capture transfers TO user

The issue was in the extractAssetIdsFromTransaction() function at story.js:1578. It was capturing ALL logtransfer actions in the transaction, including:

Pack asset being burned/transferred
Intermediate transfers by atomicpacksx contract
