Why Mint Numbers Show "?"
The blockchain RPC only returns raw asset data (asset_id, template_id, etc.). Mint numbers are calculated by the AtomicAssets API indexer based on minting order. To get them via RPC, we'd need to:

Query all minted assets for each template (very slow)
Calculate the order manually
This would defeat the purpose of using LIVE blockchain data for instant updates.

