Users should be able to claim the same template multiple times (that's what cooldowns are for)
The cooldown logic already prevents too-frequent claims
The constraint breaks when processing multiple claims in the same second
Should I remove this constraint? It's preventing legitimate multi-reward claims from being recorded properly, even though the NFTs are actually minting successfully.

